From 67891adaa5316bc110ff81de504fe2a3c9eb5837 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (for F1R3FLY.io)" <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:25:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] F1R3Gaze upstream work packages U1, U3, U4, U6 for CampF1R3

U1  K1G ground data: Bool, Int (i64), Str, Bytes, List, Tuple, Map through
    lexer, parser (Level::K1G), AST, normaliser, encoding tags 0x09-0x0F,
    decoding, substitution, JSON, printer and spatial matcher.
U3  Machine::with_observer; Observer::observe_aperture.
U4  Apertures: bind_aperture, take_outbound, inject.
U6  Keyed minter.
    A job whose cut an observer refuses is requeued at the head.

Fixes to existing behaviour:
- substitution reversed the arguments of polyadic sends (rebuild.rs);
- name binding bypassed @*x = x at three sites (process pattern *y, datum
  against a name pattern, Chan::quote);
- a quoted pattern @{*y} could not match a concrete name.

Tests: 181 (170 existing + 11 in crates/f1r3x/tests/k1g.rs).
